<h1>JOURNEY OF RCB</h1>

<div class="box">
<p>Royal Challengers Bengaluru (RCB) is one of the most popular teams of the Indian Premier League. The team was founded in 2008 and is based in Bengaluru, Karnataka. Its motto is "Ee Sala Cup Namde" which means "This year, the cup is ours".</p>

<p>RCB is known for its loyal fans and star players like Virat Kohli, AB de Villiers, and Faf du Plessis. For many years RCB reached the finals 3 times but could not win the trophy. Finally, after 18 years of waiting, RCB won their maiden IPL title in 2025 by defeating Punjab Kings by 6 runs in the final at Ahmedabad, under captain Rajat Patidar. In 2026 they won again and became champions for the second time.</p>

<p>RCB is not just a team, it is an emotion for crores of fans who support the team every year in red and black jersey.</p>

